From: Chad Monroe <chad@monroe.io>
Date: Thu, 08 Oct 2026 08:26:40 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: cfg80211: count the airtime of an MLO station once

The MLD aggregation adds the TX and RX airtime of each link to the
station total. mac80211 already fills the station total from the
airtime that the driver reports for the whole station. An MLO station
then reports about twice its real airtime. If the driver reports no
airtime per link, mac80211 copies the station total into each link,
and the error grows with the number of links.

Add the airtime of the links only if the station level reports none.
The station dump, the station query and the removal event then count
the airtime of an MLO station once. The station value takes
precedence, because it also holds the airtime of links that the
station removed. The airtime of each link does not change.

Fixes: 2d226d41db4b ("wifi: cfg80211: add statistics for providing overview for MLO station")
Signed-off-by: Chad Monroe <chad@monroe.io>
---
 net/wireless/nl80211.c |   12 ++++++++----
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

--- a/net/wireless/nl80211.c
+++ b/net/wireless/nl80211.c
@@ -8304,6 +8304,7 @@ static void cfg80211_sta_set_mld_sinfo(s
 	int link_id, init = 0;
 	u32 link_inactive_time;
 	u32 txrate_inactive_time = U32_MAX, rxrate_inactive_time = U32_MAX;
+	u64 sta_filled = sinfo->filled;
 
 	sinfo->signal = -99;
 
@@ -8443,14 +8444,17 @@ static void cfg80211_sta_set_mld_sinfo(s
 			sinfo->filled |= BIT_ULL(NL80211_STA_INFO_RX_BITRATE);
 		}
 
-		if (link_sinfo->filled &
-		    BIT_ULL(NL80211_STA_INFO_TX_DURATION)) {
+		/* The station level counts the airtime of the whole MLD */
+		if (!(sta_filled & BIT_ULL(NL80211_STA_INFO_TX_DURATION)) &&
+		    (link_sinfo->filled &
+		     BIT_ULL(NL80211_STA_INFO_TX_DURATION))) {
 			sinfo->tx_duration += link_sinfo->tx_duration;
 			sinfo->filled |=
 				BIT_ULL(NL80211_STA_INFO_TX_DURATION);
 		}
-		if (link_sinfo->filled &
-		    BIT_ULL(NL80211_STA_INFO_RX_DURATION)) {
+		if (!(sta_filled & BIT_ULL(NL80211_STA_INFO_RX_DURATION)) &&
+		    (link_sinfo->filled &
+		     BIT_ULL(NL80211_STA_INFO_RX_DURATION))) {
 			sinfo->rx_duration += link_sinfo->rx_duration;
 			sinfo->filled |=
 				BIT_ULL(NL80211_STA_INFO_RX_DURATION);
